"sieve": "<svg viewBox=\"43.2 9.3 433.5 321.3\" class=\"figsvg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><style>.figsvg .ln, .figsvg .rd, .figsvg .strike{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.figsvg .ln{stroke:rgba(255,254,247,0.904);stroke-width:2.40}\n.figsvg .rd{stroke:#F4D46A;stroke-width:3.20}\n.figsvg .thin{stroke:rgba(255,254,247,0.556);stroke-width:1.60}\n.figsvg .strike{stroke:rgba(226,138,128,0.85);stroke-width:2.60}\n.figsvg .nd{fill:#F4D46A;stroke:none}\n.figsvg .flame{fill:#F4D46A;stroke:none}\n.figsvg .halo2{fill:rgba(244,212,106,0.288);stroke:none}\n.figsvg text{text-anchor:middle;font-family:'NoorCard',system-ui,sans-serif}\n.figsvg .ts{text-anchor:start}\n.figsvg .te{text-anchor:end}\n.figsvg .t1{font-size:26.0px;font-weight:800;fill:#FFFEF7}\n.figsvg .t2{font-size:20.0px;fill:rgba(255,254,247,0.931)}\n.figsvg .t3{font-size:17.0px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;fill:rgba(244,212,106,0.72)}\n.figsvg .t4{font-size:17.0px;fill:rgba(255,254,247,0.837)}\n.figsvg .big{font-size:34.0px}\n.figsvg .gold{fill:#F4D46A}\n.figsvg .lamp-off .ln{stroke:rgba(255,254,247,0.529)}</style>\n\n<title id=\"pbuk-t\">A sieve narrowing six hundred thousand collected reports down to the few thousand that passed every test</title>\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"32\" class=\"t3\">the sieve</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"64\" class=\"t4\">600,000 reports, by the tradition’s own count</text><g class=\"ln\"><path d=\"M50 84L202 210v30h116v-30L470 84\"/></g><g class=\"rd\"><path d=\"M64 96h392M101 126h318M137 156h246M173 186h174\"/></g><g class=\"mo\"><text x=\"260\" y=\"118\" class=\"t4\">did each one truly meet the next?</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"148\" class=\"t4\">how exact was his memory?</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"178\" class=\"t4\">and what was he like?</text></g><g class=\"rd\"><path d=\"M254 244L162 264M266 244L358 264\"/></g><g class=\"mo-pop\"><text x=\"150\" y=\"296\" class=\"t1 gold\">7,275</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"296\" class=\"t1 gold\">2,600</text></g><g class=\"mo\"><text x=\"150\" y=\"320\" class=\"t4\">with repetitions</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"320\" class=\"t4\">counted once each</text></g>\n</svg>",
